WEBVTT

00:06:57.292 --> 00:07:00.476
With a million, million voice

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:03.684
Can't stop I, won't stop I

00:07:03.708 --> 00:07:07.101
With a million, million voice

00:07:07.125 --> 00:07:08.643
Can I be your leader

00:07:08.667 --> 00:07:10.393
Can I be your Caesar

00:07:10.417 --> 00:07:13.476
If I show you how to make some more
will you pledge allegiance

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.101
Is it always either

00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:16.768
Me or you or neither

00:07:16.792 --> 00:07:19.851
If I show you where I'm coming from,
will you take a breather?

00:07:19.875 --> 00:07:23.309
Cos what you'll find -- what you'll find

00:07:23.333 --> 00:07:26.268
What you'll find
guarantee will blow your mind!

00:07:26.292 --> 00:07:29.518
I'll blow your mind -- I'll blow your mind

00:07:29.542 --> 00:07:32.559
And then you'll see the reason
I stay on my grind